    }
   ],
   "Kind": "submission"
  },
  {
   "At": "2026-09-11T11:35:00+10:00",
   "Kind": "self-reflection"
  },
  {
   "Feedback": {
    "Action": "Feedback",
    "At": "2026-10-25T21:20:00+11:00",
    "CommentHTML": "<p>Excellent work, a well-earned A grade; your speaking time was 2min 10sec. Your argument was layered and carefully built, and it fully earned the content marks. Your use of rhetorical questions, concrete examples and a measured tone made the speech persuasive. You also spoke with conviction and projected well.<br/><br/>For future speeches, aim for more eye contact and more variety in pitch and pace. This was one of the strongest speeches in the year level, and it would suit a debating competition. Keep building on this work next year.<br/><br/>Your allocation of marks was 9, 10, 10 and 9.</p>",
    "Files": [],
    "Mark": "38 / 40",
    "Teacher": "Ms Kim Ward"
   },
   "Kind": "feedback"
  }
 ],
 "MarkScheme": {
  "Mode": "raw",
  "TotalMark": 40
 },
 "Rubrics": [
  {
   "Criteria": [
    {
     "Indicators": [
      {
       "Descriptors": [
        {
         "Level": "<p>Excellent</p>\n",
         "Points": 10,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>Delivery is confident and varied, holding attention and stressing each key point.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Strong</p>\n",
         "Points": 8,
         "Selected": true,
         "Text": "<p>Delivery is clear and well paced, stressing most key points.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Sound</p>\n",
         "Points": 6,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>Delivery is mostly clear, with some uneven pacing.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Developing</p>\n",
         "Points": 4,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>Delivery is often unclear or rushed.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Beginning</p>\n",
         "Points": 2,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>Delivery is hard to follow throughout.</p>\n"
        }
       ],
       "Name": "<p>Delivery</p>\n"
      },
      {
       "Descriptors": [
        {
         "Level": "<p>Excellent</p>\n",
         "Points": 10,
         "Selected": true,
         "Text": "<p>The argument is original, well supported and anticipates counterpoints.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Strong</p>\n",
         "Points": 8,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>The argument is clear and supported with relevant evidence.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Sound</p>\n",
         "Points": 6,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>The argument is clear but relies on obvious evidence.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Developing</p>\n",
         "Points": 4,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>The argument is partly developed and loosely supported.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Beginning</p>\n",
         "Points": 2,
         "Selected": false,
         "Text": "<p>The argument is unclear or unsupported.</p>\n"
        }
       ],
       "Name": "<p>Argument</p>\n"
      },
      {
       "Descriptors": [
        {
         "Level": "<p>Excellent</p>\n",
         "Points": 10,
         "Selected": true,
         "Text": "<p>Persuasive techniques are varied and used to strong effect.</p>\n"
        },
        {
         "Level": "<p>Strong</p>\n",
         "Points": 8,
