{
 "DescriptionHTML": "<h2><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,223,141);color:rgb(61,43,38);\"><span class=\"sb-ck-sticky-note\">Complete the following work in the Übungsbuch (workbook). The task instruction for each task has been translated for you below. </span></span></h2><h4><strong>Übungsbuch - Seite 92, Nummer 4</strong></h4><h4>a) What fits where? Match the blue words into the table. </h4><h4>b) What fits together? Connect. </h4><h4>c) What is correct? Cross in.</h4><h4>d) In the afternoon. Write the sentences correctly. Watch out: the word order is already given to you. You will need to adjust the endings and use the correct way to talk about the place. <br/><i>(Not sure how to do it? Check the grammar boxes on p. 85 and p. 86 in your Kursbücher.)</i></h4><h4> </h4><p> </p><h4><strong>Übungsbuch - Seite 97</strong></h4><h3><span style=\"color:rgb(217,38,38);\">Spend the rest of the homework time on the learning the vocabs for the upcoming vocab quiz.</span><br/><span class=\"mejs__offscreen\"><strong>ation</strong></span></h3><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><h5>Tick box when done. ✅ Your work will be checked in class during our second lesson of the week. </h5>",
